ind":"announcement","title":"Current State of Development","summary":"Today, it's the first day of Steam Next Fest. I thought I'd give a quick summary of where the project stands. First off, for anyone who hasn't seen it, Perfect Son-In-Law will most likely be released in February 2027. I had to push back this release date so I could do this story justice. While developing it, I keep thinking this is the best game I've ever created. I like the story, I like the world, I like the characters. I'm excited, and I hope you guys are as well. Most people who read this ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:07:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486840-1842212951303723","game_id":"steam-4486840","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO - Released","summary":"Let's talk a little about this project. If you know your genres and you hear that there is a game where dungeons start appearing, and people start to awaken, you probably think of fight scenes and powerscaling. The most prominent example of the genre would be Solo Leveling. Now, truth be told, that's not in the budget. There is a second genre. The 'you're not good enough for my daughter' type of story. And that's exactly where Perfect Son-In-Law shines. The usual powerscaling/dungeon story works","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T16:17:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303723","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486840-1840310314345597","game_id":"steam-4486840","kind":"announcement","title":"⚡Future Plans⚡","summary":"Update: This Roadmap is no longer up to date. The full game will probably be released in February 2027 and not November 2026. The two important events for everyone here on Steam are the Demo Release in three weeks, on the 28th of August, and the release of the full game, on the 20th of November.This is quite an ambitious schedule, but it should be possible. Wish me luck 😅On a different note, Perfect Son-In-Law is currently participating in the 👉NSFW Hot Summer Festival 2026. There are a bunch of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T16:48:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345597","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486840-1836506165548047","game_id":"steam-4486840","kind":"announcement","title":"Main Menu Finished and Operational","summary":"Yesterday, I handed the Demo of Perfect Son-In-Law to Steam for review. If everything goes well, I aim to release the Demo in mid-August. Fingers crossed. My previous game is coming to an end. It's already at the point where it only needs a few more touches. Unsurprisingly, I had some time to spend on Perfect Son-In-Law. I created the main menu:What you can't see, but what I insisted on, is that the text on the buttons isn't hard-coded in the image asset; it's created by the game itself. This me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T06:36:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165548047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486840-1832700592785501","game_id":"steam-4486840","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Start","summary":"This week, we reached 2000 wishlists!!!We hit the first milestone, 1000 wishlists, fairly early on. This means the store page launch was a success in itself. Back then, I didn't want to jump to conclusions. I knew the real test for a game is if it gathers interest organically, even when there is no major marketing event happening in the background. Seeing the number of wishlists climb steadily gives me a sense of ease. People are excited for this game. And I want to thank everybody who is lookin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T06:59:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592785501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4486840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4486840":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4486840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4639180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4486840","app_id":4486840,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e5cd90265e2c9c35b57a8e1eeb50a48b16ee0e90202367892700ee9adc21a752","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"그녀는 당신에게 자신의 남자친구 역할을 맡아 달라고 한다. 그리고 당신은 그 역할을 충분히 해낼 수 있다. 비밀스럽게 압도적인 힘을 지닌 Awakener가 되어 상류 사회, 위험한 기대, 그리고 점점 진짜가 되어가는 가짜 관계 사이를 헤쳐 나가는 스토리 중심의 NSFW 비주얼 노벨.","publishers":[{"name":"HighbornTiger","creator_clan_account_id":46033461}],"developers":[{"name":"HighbornTiger","creator_clan_account_id":46033461}]},"release":{"steam_release_date"